DESCRIPTION:eeff2160        XBD.netinet_tcp.h.001
DESCRIPTION:1c9a7bc0        untestable  the effect (small segments held back or not) is visible only in the timing of the network traffic, and the next unit lets the implementation refuse to set or read the option at all
DESCRIPTION:6b99451b        none  permission: the implementation may refuse setting or retrieving the option, so no outcome of those calls is required
